nie Winkler is president of the  largest teachers union in Kentucky  education in Kentucky is right now in  limbo and we want to make sure that our  students get everything that they need  a huge crowd is also expected in  Kentucky because most of the schools  there are on spring break in fact only  three school districts in the Bluegrass  State will be open today viana Omar  thank you
 

